    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa, the protagonist attending a certain academy,<br>comes across a Grimoire that seals the soul of a powerful sorcerer by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its power, Alisa becomes a sorcerer herself and learns that the academy she attends is actually a laboratory for magical experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her loved ones from danger and to strengthen her own abilities, Alisa takes on a battle against sorcerers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern-style RPG.<br>Engage with incidents occurring in the academy and town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich CG content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic command-based battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to steal and equip their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original enemy graphics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa, the protagonist attending a certain academy,<br>comes across a Grimoire that seals the soul of a powerful sorcerer by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its power, Alisa becomes a sorcerer herself and learns that the academy she attends is actually a laboratory for magical experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her loved ones from danger and to strengthen her own abilities, Alisa takes on a battle against sorcerers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern-style RPG.<br>Engage with incidents occurring in the academy and town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364970/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752719506\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich CG content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic command-based battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to steal and equip their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original enemy graphics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
